  "comments": "<p>There are main groups of obverse and reverse.<br><br><i>Obverse</i><br>Die <strong>1</strong> - letters in REPUBLICA DE COLOMBIA short, there are no vertical lines of background pattern inside mashes of P and O in PESOS.<br>Die <strong>2</strong> - letters in REPUBLICA DE COLOMBIA short, there is vertical line of background pattern inside each mash of P and O in PESOS.<br>Die <strong>3</strong> - letters in REPUBLICA DE COLOMBIA tall, there is vertical line of background pattern inside each mash of P and O in PESOS.<br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5d598a303a19f.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5d598a303a19f.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>Reverse</i><br><br>Die <strong>A</strong> - all 4 narrow lines in motif point to gap in between beads.<br>Die <strong>B</strong> - each of 4 narrow lines in motif point to bead.<br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5d598a499bc6f.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5d598a499bc6f.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><strong>Combinations</strong><br><strong>1</strong>+<strong>A</strong> 1994.<br><strong>2</strong>+<strong>A</strong> 1995-1997.<br><strong>3</strong>+<strong>A </strong>1997, 2004-2007.<br><strong>3</strong>+<strong>B</strong> 2008-2012.<br><br>For 1995 there are some coins with an additional dot in the central circle, making 5 dots on the reverse.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/656897d5efa1d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/656897d5efa1d.jpg\"></a><br>Although Krause shows mintage numbers for 2003, this coin was not issued with that year.</p>",
